(6743959, 1010348, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wow.  What the heck is that concoction?  Good composition.  Seems to have a bit of artifacting but my screen is very bright and I can sometimes see stuff most people cannot see.</td>', 'Wow.  What the heck is that concoction?  Good composition.  Seems to have a bit of artifacting but my screen is very bright and I can sometimes see stuff most people cannot see.', '2012-04-16 23:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
