(6748629, 1010422, 14001, '<td valign="top">Tells the best story in all the group; there''s action, drama and a reason for the heads not being shown, 10.  Technically, I think the photo needed more adjustment to remove more of the harsh lighting of the sun (contrast, black point, saturation etc), but excellent field execution none-the-less, and deserve a 10 for that aspect.   The shot is fine without seeing the heads and that''s difficult!!</td>', 'Tells the best story in all the group; there''s action, drama and a reason for the heads not being shown, 10.  Technically, I think the photo needed more adjustment to remove more of the harsh lighting of the sun (contrast, black point, saturation etc), but excellent field execution none-the-less, and deserve a 10 for that aspect.   The shot is fine without seeing the heads and that''s difficult!!', '2012-04-22 09:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
