(6751118, 1010314, 49954, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by HawkinsT:</b></div><hr/><i> Hah, fantastic satire! I guess I understand the score in that the image isn''t centred around the challenge description but feels more to me as though it''s been made to fit the challenge after your initial idea (perhaps I''m mistaken but that''s the sense I get), but still, very amusing =). </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Actually, the idea was 100% created for this challenge... The goal being to vent a (phony) complaint, but doing it anonymously with my head cropped off.  Now you may be right that people viewed it as you suggested, but the reality is what it is. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by HawkinsT: Hah, fantastic satire! I guess I understand the score in that the image isn''t centred around the challenge description but feels more to me as though it''s been made to fit the challenge after your initial idea (perhaps I''m mistaken but that''s the sense I get), but still, very amusing =).   Actually, the idea was 100% created for this challenge... The goal being to vent a (phony) complaint, but doing it anonymously with my head cropped off.  Now you may be right that people viewed it as you suggested, but the reality is what it is. :)', '2012-04-25 02:03:00.000000', NULL, 0),
