(6752666, 1010296, 127021, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by blindjustice:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by salmiakki:</b></div><hr/><i> This is excellent.  One of my highest scoring in this challenge.  Suprised it did not do better. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I am shocked as well. This had a nice grainy quality and a good story to it; perhaps people felt there was no reason for the head not to be there. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh well... I''m happy I got no 1''s and only one 2 and one 3!!! :) Thanks though....</td>', 'Originally posted by blindjustice: Originally posted by salmiakki: This is excellent.  One of my highest scoring in this challenge.  Suprised it did not do better.   I am shocked as well. This had a nice grainy quality and a good story to it; perhaps people felt there was no reason for the head not to be there.   Oh well... I''m happy I got no 1''s and only one 2 and one 3!!! :) Thanks though....', '2012-04-26 20:59:03.000000', NULL, 0),
